{"id":24065,"date":"2020-03-23T09:18:03","date_gmt":"2020-03-23T09:18:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?p=24065"},"modified":"2023-05-17T10:55:14","modified_gmt":"2023-05-17T09:55:14","slug":"how-to-send-a-standard-email-on-a-regular-basis","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/how-to-send-a-standard-email-on-a-regular-basis\/","title":{"rendered":"How to send a standard email on a regular basis"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The school has asked us to send an absence email in every morning and People are asking how they can automate it.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">DO NOT DO WHAT I DID AND ACCIDENTALLY SEND THEM AN EMAIL EVERY MINUTE! SORRY ADMIN \ud83d\ude42 For testing PLEASE send it to yourself or another email address&#8230; then set it to once daily.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">IF you use Microsoft Outlook at least here is a solution, using a little known feature of Office called FLOW..<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-3-1024x683.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24066 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/683;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">First, you click on here: <strong><a href=\"http:\/\/flow.microsoft.com\">flow.microsoft.com<\/a> <\/strong> You should see the above screen.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you already pay for Microsoft office then use that account. If you have a Microsoft account maybe use the trial? <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-4-828x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24067 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 828px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 828\/1024;\" \/><figcaption>CLick on Create<br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-5-1024x450.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24068 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/450;\" \/><figcaption>Pick Scheduled Flow<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-6-1024x660.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24069 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/660;\" \/><figcaption>Build the flow like this and press create<br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-7-1024x294.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24070 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/294;\" \/><figcaption>click New step<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-8-1024x766.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24071 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/766;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Type outlook into the search and select &#8220;Send an email&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-9-1024x777.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24072 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/777;\" \/><figcaption><br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fill out your email something like this&#8230;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-10-1024x961.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24073 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/961;\" \/><figcaption><br><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ve got some advanced options if you need them&#8230; I don&#8217;t.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Click Save then you can use the checker and the test to make sure you didn&#8217;t make any mistakes. Hope this helps.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/image-11.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24074 lazyload\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 417px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 417\/123;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you use Gmail, an app called <a href=\"https:\/\/www.boomeranggmail.com\/l\/recurring-email.html\">Boomerang <\/a>may help<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The school has asked us to send an absence email in every morning and People are asking how they can automate it. DO NOT DO WHAT I DID AND ACCIDENTALLY SEND THEM AN EMAIL EVERY MINUTE! SORRY ADMIN \ud83d\ude42 For testing PLEASE send it to yourself or another email address&#8230; then set it to once<a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/how-to-send-a-standard-email-on-a-regular-basis\/\" title=\"ReadHow to send a standard email on a regular basis\">&#8230; Read more &raquo;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[14],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-24065","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-newdawn"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>How to send a standard email on a regular basis - The Excel Experts<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/how-to-send-a-standard-email-on-a-regular-basis\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"How to send a standard email on a regular basis - The Excel Experts\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description